  "sourceTitle": "Improving Hugging Face Training Efficiency Through Packing with Flash Attention 2",
  "sourceBodyHash": "2f1ca51c3f3d36519daa3fb7afbe58726b629eee9f26fdce5fb446ee79f02409",
